tId === subject.id)!.grade)">{{ selectedEntries.find(entry => entry.subjectId === subject.id)?.grade }}</span></td><td class="py-3">{{ selectedEntries.find(entry => entry.subjectId === subject.id)?.gradePoint.toFixed(1) ?? '—' }}</td><td class="py-3">{{ selectedEntries.find(entry => entry.subjectId === subject.id) ? (selectedEntries.find(entry => entry.subjectId === subject.id)!.gradePoint * subject.credits).toFixed(1) : '—' }}</td></tr></tbody></table><div v-if="selected.publicationStatus === 'draft'" class="space-y-3 border-t border-navy-100 pt-4"><button class="rounded-lg bg-navy-800 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white" @click="approve">Approve Result</button><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row"><input v-model="correctionReason" class="flex-1 rounded-lg border border-navy-200 px-3 py-2 text-sm" placeholder="Reason for returning for correction" /><button class="rounded-lg border border-amber-300 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-amber-700" @click="returnForCorrection">Return for Correction</button></div></div><div v-else class="rounded-lg bg-blue-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-blue-700">This result is approved and ready for publication.</div></div></div></div>
